abstract: "Bilingual Next.js application for exploring the frozen MétaCan Canadian research frame, its recorded admission routes, direct machine screening evidence, teacher imitation classifier output, collaboration network, and a separate rolling OpenAlex layer. Human classifier accuracy has not yet been established."
